==Description==
The mix of [[Dark Elf]] and [[Human]] is a rarity. Recently, a community of Half-Dark Elves calling themselves the Ayr'Haeth were discovered living in [[Nektropos Undercrofts]] under [[Nektropos Castle]]. They had lived there for generations, hidden, but were forced to seek help from the other races once [[Lord Rikantus Everling]] went mad due to the death of his daughters. [[Freeport]] Humans, [[Neriak]] Dark Elves, and the members of the [[Temple of Solusek Ro]] denied sending help. 

==Basic Information==
*<b>[[Faction Alignment|Faction Alignment:]]</b> Neutral
*<b>Racial(s):</b> [[Hide]], [[Sneak]], [[Infravision]], [[Cursed Heritage]], [[Life Tracking]]
*<b>Starting City:</b> [[Nektropos Undercrofts]]
*<b>Primary Class Choices:</b> [[Bard]], [[Berserker]], [[Enchanter]], [[Necromancer]], [[Ranger]], [[Rogue]], [[Shadow Knight]] (Based on Guild Masters in [[Nektropos Undercrofts]]).

