Notably the worst Wisdom of all races.

==Infravision==
Slightly improved night vision, not as good as the [[Dark Elf|Dark Elf]]'s [[Character Races#Ultravision|Ultravision]].

==Cursed Heritage==
10% increased effectiveness of lifetaps (such as [[Drain Soul]] or [[Life Leech]]) and runes (such as [[Diamondskin]] or [[Rune IV]]). 20% reduced base health regeneration, when outdoors in the day.

==Life Tracking==
Increased sensory range for living NPCs on your map -- roughly double in radius.

== Unlock Conditions ==

* Complete [[Something Fishy]], [[Alchemical Solution]], [[What%27s_going_on_here|What's Going On Here]], [[Call for Aid]], and [[Unfortunate News]]. 


